            <div xml:id="m-3978a544-4fe5-4685-a577-ea1000b545e4">
              <lg xml:id="m-2f1ac7b6-c8a6-4fa9-9058-a3faf6a11f63">
                <l xml:id="m-2b77c222-e4fb-40a6-b013-ab4f878dbb70" facs="#m-ded5a562-84e9-4ca6-b10c-17eb23c25658" label="ambiguous">HOLY SATURDAY</l><l xml:id="m-0c010a26-626d-44a8-a772-61d012326486" facs="#m-e13fc289-87a2-456f-85ef-960b3cd679ca" label="text-like">Double of the First Class</l><l xml:id="m-64b1c936-2865-477f-8bd1-a4627f545fa2" facs="#m-da18b3fc-ef2a-42fa-afae-a25cee585108" label="text-like">The faithful should be carefully instructed about the special Liturgy</l><l xml:id="m-b9b0acd1-2a4b-4cd5-9359-10f4abecf006" facs="#m-03ccd1f0-863a-49dd-8aca-461002f60bad" label="text-like">of Holy Saturday. It is a day of great sorrow, when the Church waits</l><l xml:id="m-27b174d4-d53e-4a4e-89d6-112b69bd83e5" facs="#m-7d84ace7-ae5b-4db0-ba30-6ea4f168b507" label="text-like">by the tomb of Our Lord, meditating on His Passion and Death; the</l><l xml:id="m-8dd8f8bd-a2ae-40bf-9b7c-87c3bfa9b1d9" facs="#m-e71e3c7a-0ab6-4b49-ba19-c96def30053e" label="text-like">Holy Sacrifice of the Mass is not offered, and the altars are stripped;</l><l xml:id="m-9e627e9d-3b29-4886-8756-1c631e3e5ad0" facs="#m-1b79e024-e857-4922-840d-c432a7e2c46b" label="text-like">until, after the Solemn Vigil (or awaiting of Our Lord’s Resurrection</l><l xml:id="m-59fee50c-08c9-4815-af12-ea2bc7254af4" facs="#m-fcf9ddee-571f-43da-8a9c-bbd02cd0a4ba" label="text-like">in the night) all this gives place to the joy of Easter, which overflowe</l><l xml:id="m-8e711016-fa41-4cec-b9ef-56d958e4a320" facs="#m-6e74a809-f9a5-4f02-88c0-83d94bedaf50" label="text-like">into the following days.</l><l xml:id="m-92810b8a-8e5a-41f5-a696-85e415c4a548" facs="#m-eb4c46ed-bdd0-4bd9-919a-9f2acaa23b79" label="text-like">THE DIVINE OFFICE</l><l xml:id="m-01436ac7-7fd2-4452-a6ed-3fe911351716" facs="#m-e004ec18-5ddc-4d7d-89cd-2b8aec15d0f7" label="ambiguous">AT' MATINS</l><l xml:id="m-70614d80-7f80-4f91-81aa-23977d7e553b" facs="#m-587e393a-9840-4fc6-ad6e-6f914142c959" label="text-like">The altar must be bare, except for the Cross and four (lighted) candles,</l><l xml:id="m-ece1a5f6-46ca-46cb-a6ad-e17fd46c7d24" facs="#m-2deaa4fb-6a5c-4334-8b60-0580a0f6ff70" label="text-like">that remained after the Good Friday Liturg.</l><l xml:id="m-e8ff56e2-b3d2-49c2-afe9-9261e4afb8d7" facs="#m-90013aa5-4729-45a8-a7c3-d038511bb19e" label="ambiguous">INTHE IST NOCTURN</l><l xml:id="m-aa0360af-0cc6-4296-a28f-05a7532a1c78" facs="#m-81f9df6d-a6d2-42cb-a94d-0f8355e8adad" label="ambiguous">1 Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-69cc961e-11d5-409a-bff9-412e8bc2fc41" facs="#m-bc18743c-7f8f-45d4-9441-85faca33e0de" label="lyrics-like">Npáce“ in id-ípsum, dórmi-am et requi-éscam.</l><l xml:id="m-5d869ba7-e3ec-40cc-a97b-c2d785696337" facs="#m-81e718b4-bb6d-40ea-9136-26316ca32526" label="ambiguous">A</l><l xml:id="m-fd7c2f88-86d2-45ba-bc63-6093593a4b25" facs="#m-6f3c0a86-99e3-428f-842f-27b7a0d4e406" label="lyrics-like">Ps.4. Cum invocárem. (without Glória), p.264. (New psalter, p. 56*).</l><l xml:id="m-cd6b8a01-0d99-4226-974f-4b22ac04d6f8" facs="#m-ac3b6dee-a3fe-462e-b95c-001295f46a60" label="ambiguous">2 Ant.E</l><l xml:id="m-dd653adc-8dd6-4487-8bbf-41703160d8c1" facs="#m-a6f020ec-5fd2-4efa-9c60-a27807b473ac" label="ambiguous">4E</l><l xml:id="m-8160c5c4-10bb-40f5-858f-eab9e94e53b4" facs="#m-dd4ded6c-92e5-4e25-bcd3-1088e418c26f" label="lyrics-like">LAbi-tábit“ in tabernácu-lo tú-o, requi-éscet in</l><l xml:id="m-632c1eea-1084-427d-9284-491e32ebf3af" facs="#m-3f4cf929-9e41-42b9-bfd2-265bfbf5ce3e" label="lyrics-like">mónte sáncto tú-o.</l><l xml:id="m-2452af0b-a39b-41bb-8362-1782e0d9d89e" facs="#m-626753d8-4ca6-46eb-9b71-24a02a8bc19c" label="ambiguous">Psalm 14 (New psalter, p. 57*)</l><l xml:id="m-c5da3519-fdc7-4ea0-b9a5-7565e6dea32f" facs="#m-e1717f41-b79a-495b-aebe-a1f055acea3a" label="lyrics-like">1. Dómine, quis habi-tábit in tabernácu-lo tû¬ o"“aut quis</l><l xml:id="m-c044fd6b-2d57-4c4c-9c53-c539e224aa26" facs="#m-2db100df-3e77-4a38-937f-dcb63e867940" label="ambiguous">Versicle 7</l><l xml:id="m-5f88c798-ee82-4b8f-8e8c-c95ae8081598" facs="#m-b47f2ab3-2c35-4094-86f4-a75aec4c2314" label="lyrics-like">requi-éscet in mónte sáncto tú-o? Qui fácit haec,</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>